<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Global Grant Writer — Professional Grant Writing Services</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    :root {
      --primary: #1a5632;
      --primary-light: #2d8a52;
      --accent: #f4a300;
      --dark: #1a1a2e;
      --light: #f8f9fa;
      --gray: #6c757d;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--dark);
      background: var(--light);
    }

    /* Header */
    header {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 1rem 2rem;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    }

    nav {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    .logo span { color: var(--accent); }

    nav ul {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    nav a:hover { color: var(--accent); }

    /* Hero */
    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--primary-light) 100%);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 5rem 2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto 2rem;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.9rem 2.2rem;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: var(--dark);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(244,163,0,0.4);
    }

    .btn-outline {
      border: 2px solid #fff;
      color: #fff;
      margin-left: 1rem;
    }

    .btn-outline:hover {
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    /* Stats */
    .stats {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 3rem;
      padding: 3rem 2rem;
      background: #fff;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .stat { text-align: center; }

    .stat .num {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    .stat .label {
      color: var(--gray);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    /* Services */
    .services {
      padding: 4rem 2rem;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      color: var(--dark);
    }

    .section-subtitle {
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--gray);
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .card {
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 2rem;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
    }

    .card .icon {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .card h3 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    .card p {
      color: var(--gray);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    /* Process */
    .process {
      background: #fff;
      padding: 4rem 2rem;
    }

    .steps {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .step {
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
    }

    .step .circle {
      width: 60px;
      height: 60px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0 auto 1rem;
    }

    .step h4 {
      color: var(--dark);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .step p {
      color: var(--gray);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    /* CTA */
    .cta {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--primary-light) 100%);
      color: #fff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 4rem 2rem;
    }

    .cta h2 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .cta p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      background: var(--dark);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    footer p {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    footer .logo { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .hero h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
      nav ul { display: none; }
      .stats { flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; }
      .btn-outline { margin-left: 0; margin-top: 1rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <nav>
      <div class="logo">Global<span>Grant</span>Writer</div>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
        <li><a href="#process">Process</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Win More Grants With Expert Writing</h1>
    <p>We help nonprofits, researchers, and businesses secure funding through compelling, well-researched grant proposals.</p>
    <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get Started Free</a>
    <a href="#services" class="btn btn-outline">Our Services</a>
  </section>

  <section class="stats">
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="num">$12M+</div>
      <div class="label">Funding Secured</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="num">250+</div>
      <div class="label">Proposals Written</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="num">85%</div>
      <div class="label">Success Rate</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="services" id="services">
    <h2 class="section-title">Our Services</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Comprehensive grant writing support from start to finish</p>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">📝</div>
        <h3>Grant Proposal Writing</h3>
        <p>Custom-crafted proposals tailored to each funder's requirements, highlighting your mission and impact.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">🔍</div>
        <h3>Grant Research</h3>
        <p>We identify the best funding opportunities matched to your organization's goals and eligibility.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">📊</div>
        <h3>Budget Development</h3>
        <p>Detailed, accurate budgets and narratives that align with your program objectives and funder guidelines.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">✅</div>
        <h3>Proposal Review</h3>
        <p>Expert review of your existing proposals to strengthen narratives, fix gaps, and boost your win rate.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">📅</div>
        <h3>Grant Management</h3>
        <p>Ongoing support with reporting, compliance, and renewal applications to maintain your funding.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">🤝</div>
        <h3>Consulting & Training</h3>
        <p>Workshops and one-on-one coaching to build your team's internal grant writing capacity.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="process" id="process">
    <h2 class="section-title">How It Works</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">A simple, proven process in four steps</p>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="circle">1</div>
        <h4>Free Consultation</h4>
        <p>We discuss your goals, needs, and timeline at no cost.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="circle">2</div>
        <h4>Research & Strategy</h4>
        <p>We identify funders and develop a targeted application plan.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="circle">3</div>
        <h4>Proposal Writing</h4>
        <p>We craft a compelling, funder-ready proposal for your review.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="circle">4</div>
        <h4>Submit & Win</h4>
        <p>You submit with confidence, backed by our expertise.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta" id="contact">
    <h2>Ready to Secure Your Next Grant?</h2>
    <p>Get a free consultation and find out how we can help you win more funding.</p>
    <a href="mailto:contact@globalgrantwriter.com" class="btn btn-primary">Contact Us Today</a>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <div class="logo">Global<span>Grant</span>Writer</div>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Global Grant Writer. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
